:: OC Shinju Manuel Felix Card Game [nobr]

/* Intro */
You walk up to the lunch table to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span>, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> all hunched over a collection of cards, their lunches pushed aside. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> hold cards in their hands, squinting to read the text along with flashcards in their hands as strange monster cards are laid out in front of them. They look familiar, you think you saw them on an anime on T.V. before, though as you look closer, you realize all the cards are in Japanese. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "OC Manuel",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Felix",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Awww, this is hard.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> sighs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Maybe I should just buy my own English cards? Translating them is confusing.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I mean you will do that eventually if you want to buy your own, since you can’t get the originals here.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> waves his hand about, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But learning with these isn’t that hard! Plus, the original Japanese cards are better! None of that censoring crap!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“They do love censoring breasts here.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> <span style="Color: Pink">laughs, holding up a card of a snake lady with VERY large tits. You instantly blush and turn away as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> spots you and scoffs.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Shinju",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Boobs aren’t even that sexual, just milk sacks! People in your country are so sensitive! Though I don’t think snakes produce milk, so I think that one is just for luring in men… huh…”</span> He signs and shakes his head, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Care to learn the game, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>? I have some more decks, if you’re interested. Even translated the effects on these flashcards, since you’re all uncultured!”</span> He smirks teasingly and you agree, sitting down with the group and learning the intricate details of the card game <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> calls Yokai-oh! <br>
<br>
Honestly, it is pretty fun, though very complicated. You practice with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, which leads to you being defeated over and over as he seemingly always has a card with the exact effect he needs, almost to the point where you suspect he is cheating, though he promises he isn’t with the devious smirk he always has. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Felix</span> are more evenly matched, though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Manuel</span> wins most of the matches. <span style="Color: LightGreen">In the end, you all have fun and quickly scarf down your lunch to continue playing when a teacher calls you out. <br>
<br>
Who knew cards could be so much fun?</span> <br>
<<socialChange "Felix" 3>>
<<socialChange "Manuel" 3 1>>
<<socialChange "Shinju" 3 1>>
<<needChange "Fun" 10>>
<br>
<<include "School Lunch">>
<<set $FriendLunch to 1>>